### Modifications & Derivative Nature
The files in this repository are not 1:1 mirrors of upstream assets. Modifications include:
- Composing individual floor, wall, and detail meshes into unified composite models.
- Adapting and pairing OpenForge tile meshes with OpenForge magnetic and clip bases.
- Added primitive spacer and support cubes to align, bridge, and bond the tile meshes into solid printable bodies.
